19	 * and its due-by (yyyy-MM-dd), fixed when it was added from the terms in force on the sheet's today then (its person's own, their grade's, the sheet's),
20	 * and its status log, oldest first, and the date it was last deferred until (null when never), with whether it is
21	 * deferred now: OPEN (or VOID, voided while deferred; or SETTLED, settled while bound) with that date after the sheet's today and
22	 * not bound by a statement (the deferral takes effect once the binding ends), and its proofs count, and the number (as it shows) of
23	 * the claim it was split off (null unless it was), and the user whose open editor locks it (null when none does),
24	 * and whether it was added while its period was soft-closed (a late entry), and the sheet's today it was last
25	 * reminded on (null when never), and its external reference (null for none), and its tags (lower-cased, sorted),
26	 * with every tag it has ever carried, and its comments, in the order written, and the number of the bulk settle
27	 * batch that last settled it (null when settled one at a time, or never), and its lines, in the order added, and
28	 * when it was added (the claim sequence's value; null when kept from before it was recorded), which decides the
