30	 * proofs are photos (the rest are receipts), and whether it is held (toggled while OPEN or PENDING): it still counts in
31	 * every total (a hold takes only a person's cut in the pools), and the people it is shared with, in the order shared,
32	 * each holding a share of its due, and the user a steward assigned it to review while it was REVIEW (null when none;
33	 * kept once reviewed).
